                    description: "Interest, behavior, and demographic targeting, using categories from the ad platform's targeting taxonomy. Entries across interests, behaviors, and demographics are OR'd together (anyone matching any entry is reached), matching Ads Manager's detailed-targeting box. At most 100 entries per section. Can't be combined with demographics.automatic, and unavailable to campaigns with special_ad_categories. Send the complete intended state \u2014 a section you omit is cleared."
