                    description: "What the buyer is purchasing. Each entry takes exactly one of `plan_id` or an inline `plan`. One entry charges that variant; several entries form a cart, which requires every variant to be compatible, belong to this account, and use the same currency. Mutually exclusive with `plan_id` and `plan`.",
